{"id": "04", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "School was a whole new game."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Benji was level four. [pause] His special skill was \"falling down.\""}, {"speaker": "BENJI", "text": "[cheerful] Hey, buddy! [pause] Whoa\u2014 I'm okay!"}, {"speaker": "TEACHER", "text": "[cold] Who forgot their homework?"}, {"speaker": "KID", "text": "[nervous] My dog ate it!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] You could see lies now. [pause] That one was ninety-nine percent."}, {"speaker": "TEACHER", "text": "[cold] Pop quiz. [pause] Twenty questions."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispering, scared] Difficulty... impossible."}, {"speaker": "BENJI", "text": "[whispering] Is that bad? [pause] That sounds bad."}, {"speaker": "TEACHER", "text": "[cold] Is there something on my head?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[nervous] No, ma'am! [pause] Just your... very nice... level."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "In dodgeball, you picked your team by strength. [pause] Science. Pure science."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[confident] You. And you. [pause] And definitely you, eighty-five strength."}, {"speaker": "KID", "text": "[confused] You picked the quiet kid FIRST?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[smug] Trust me. [pause] He has a secret."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You won. Every single game."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Even lunch had stats. [pause] The mystery meat just said \"question mark.\""}, {"speaker": "BENJI", "text": "[nervous] Should we eat it?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[firm] Benji. It says QUESTION MARK."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And above some people... there were little yellow marks. [pause] Like in a game."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[curious] Quests? [pause] Real life has QUESTS?"}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 2.48, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 28, "dialogue_input_index